tek-2012:p0865:b002:l006","ordinal":362942,"en":"“On a road of torment with no turning back,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l007","ordinal":362943,"en":"He met an infidel’s fate,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l008","ordinal":362944,"en":"Many people wander lamenting."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l009","ordinal":362945,"en":"Yellow with wasting sickness,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l010","ordinal":362946,"en":"Their hearts, minds, and thoughts"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l011","ordinal":362947,"en":"Are distracted—many among the people;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l012","ordinal":362948,"en":"Yellow with wasting sickness,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l013","ordinal":362949,"en":"Many mortals suffer anxiety,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l014","ordinal":362950,"en":"And all their reason and thoughts"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l015","ordinal":362951,"en":"Are distracted as well;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l016","ordinal":362952,"en":"Some have perished in battle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l017","ordinal":362953,"en":"And others too have died."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l018","ordinal":362954,"en":"“Ah, Sarybai, we are done for,” they say,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l019","ordinal":362955,"en":"“Through Choro, the blue-maned brother,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l020","ordinal":362956,"en":"We have endured great calamity,” they say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l021","ordinal":362957,"en":"“I shall seize the lands"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l022","ordinal":362958,"en":"Of the consummate blue-maned lions,” he said,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l023","ordinal":362959,"en":"“I, brother to a lion, a bloodthirsty tyrant,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l024","ordinal":362960,"en":"Shall oppress the people,” he said."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l025","ordinal":362961,"en":"“An army from the whole world gathered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l026","ordinal":362962,"en":"But in the end we were miserably slaughtered;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l027","ordinal":362963,"en":"He slew so many of us,” they say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l028","ordinal":362964,"en":"“He heeds no guilt or pity,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l029","ordinal":362965,"en":"But wrought a total massacre,” they say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l030","ordinal":362966,"en":"Their cruppers torn apart,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l031","ordinal":362967,"en":"Many wander ruined among the host;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l032","ordinal":362968,"en":"Their girths snapped,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l033","ordinal":362969,"en":"Their saddles slipped beneath their bellies,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l034","ordinal":362970,"en":"Many people rush about in panic."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l035","ordinal":362971,"en":"Staggering senseless in confusion,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l036","ordinal":362972,"en":"Their two legs dangling,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l037","ordinal":362973,"en":"Every knee scraped raw,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l038","ordinal":362974,"en":"Every rein torn apart,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l039","ordinal":362975,"en":"Armor ripped and fluttering,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b002:l040","ordinal":362976,"en":"Spears shattered with a shriek,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l001","ordinal":362977,"en":"“Ah, Sarybai has slain us,” they say,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l002","ordinal":362978,"en":"“He killed until his fury was spent,” they say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l003","ordinal":362979,"en":"“The people are ruined in massacre;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l004","ordinal":362980,"en":"Thus has God struck us,” they say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l005","ordinal":362981,"en":"“This tyrant’s offspring"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l006","ordinal":362982,"en":"Would humiliate and slaughter us,” they say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l007","ordinal":362983,"en":"“This monstrous slave Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l008","ordinal":362984,"en":"Has made sport of countless men,” they say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l009","ordinal":362985,"en":"“The Lord Creator made Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l010","ordinal":362986,"en":"Great and powerful,” they say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l011","ordinal":362987,"en":"“He inflicted misery and humiliation;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l012","ordinal":362988,"en":"Sarybai is a vicious dog,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l013","ordinal":362989,"en":"He has butchered us all,” they say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l014","ordinal":362990,"en":"“If death should overtake us suddenly,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l015","ordinal":362991,"en":"If by mischance we perish,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l016","ordinal":362992,"en":"We shall know him for the dog he is,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l017","ordinal":362993,"en":"If the rumors told are true."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l018","ordinal":362994,"en":"On the Judgment Morning at dawn,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l019","ordinal":362995,"en":"That swaggering swine"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l020","ordinal":362996,"en":"We shall make ride a black donkey,” they said."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l021","ordinal":362997,"en":"So the army clamored,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l022","ordinal":362998,"en":"Until the host lost its senses,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l023","ordinal":362999,"en":"And while they poured out their grief,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l024","ordinal":363000,"en":"Kulansur, the steed he rode,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l025","ordinal":363001,"en":"Flew rumbling like a cloud;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l026","ordinal":363002,"en":"The stones struck by his hooves"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l027","ordinal":363003,"en":"Shattered with a ringing cry."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l028","ordinal":363004,"en":"Rearing and surging forward,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l029","ordinal":363005,"en":"The riderless Kulansur"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l030","ordinal":363006,"en":"Shot ahead like an arrow;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l031","ordinal":363007,"en":"That splendid steed had a flowing mane,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0865:b004:l032","ordinal":363008,"en":"And for the young hero Seytek"}]
